{"id":"658117","name":"金雀花炒鸡蛋","author":"seiseizhang","authorId":"2304656","desc":"","cover":"images/658117/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"金雀花","amount":"100g"}],"sub":[{"name":"草鸡蛋","amount":"4个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"金雀花清水洗干净。","img":"images/658117/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"金雀花沥干后，撒上1匙盐，用手轻轻抓匀。","img":"images/658117/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"草鸡蛋打成蛋液，加入半匙盐，搅拌均匀。","img":"images/658117/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"另加一勺油，热了后放入金雀花，调中火，加盐翻炒。","img":"images/658117/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"再加入分开炒的鸡蛋，拌炒均匀。","img":"images/658117/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"春天的美食，简单清爽。","img":"images/658117/step_6.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}